<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Black Sea, 2019</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt; 
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Black Sea 08-01-2019, Version&amp;nbsp;1.0 (14 April 2019)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The Time Is: 1 August 2019, 00:01 UTC/02:00 Local Time&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Black Sea / Crimean Peninsula&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;Playable as the United States only&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;1 Day (24 Hour) Duration&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-style: italic'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This is a small scenario&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-style: italic; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Tensions between Russian and The West, and in particular the United States, have continued to increase with Russian (and American) force deployments closer to each other’s vital interest continuing into 2019. With the seizure of additional “Freedom of Navigation” (FoN) operation in the Black Sea. To not be seen as being too closely allied with Ukrainian interests the forces will base out of Romania.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-bidi-font-style: italic; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold'&gt;You are in command of CTF 60.2.1 a force of three USN vessels with direct Combat Air Support (CAP) from a USAF Squadron and AEW support from an E-3G Sentry detachment. Your orders are to avoid combat, but be prepared for combat should it be thrust upon you. The International situation is deteriorating due to the ongoing tensions heightened by the FoN operation. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Special Considerations…&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: auto 0in auto 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;1.&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;There are pop up messages describing the world situation so please turn special messages on if you want them to pop up. They will also display in your Message Log if you just want to view them there.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: auto 0in auto 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;2.&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;If you can maintain your force in the locked operations area (&lt;B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="COLOR: #c00000"&gt;please do not delete it&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;) without conflict&amp;nbsp;for 8 hours you will achieve a Triumph. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: auto 0in auto 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;3.&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;If conflict comes, and there is a slight and increasing chance throughout the scenario that may happen, the naval units are worth additional points (plus or minus for the US player only) but the fighters and fighter bombers WILL go down in droves.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: auto 0in auto 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;SPAN style="mso-list: Ignore"&gt;4.&lt;SPAN style='FONT: 7pt "Times New Roman"'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-FAMILY: "Calibri",sans-serif; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;The only aircraft that will cost you points if you lose them are the E-3G’s.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style="MARGIN: auto 0in auto 0.5in; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;EM&gt;Constructive comments &lt;/EM&gt;for improvement are appreciated!&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold'&gt;Originally created under Version 1.15 -&amp;nbsp;Build 1009.27.6&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold'&gt;An .INI and .Delta file are both provided for rebuilds.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Al “Beirutdude” Sandrik (formally known as "Beachinnole")&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ansi-language: EN'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal" align=center&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
